4. {koyu:Writing a Motto / Slogan and an Opinion Essay on Human Rights:}
• {koyu:Motto / Slogan Örnekleri:}
  - “{koyu:All human beings are born free and equal in dignity and rights.}” (Article 1 of UDHR)
  - “{koyu:Injustice anywhere is a threat to justice everywhere!}” (Martin Luther King Jr.)
  - “{koyu:Say NO to racism, say YES to humanity!}”
• {koyu:Kompozisyon (Essay) Bağlaçları:}
  - {koyu:Giriş ve Sıralama:} First of all, To begin with, Firstly (İlk olarak)
  - {koyu:Ekleme Yapma:} Furthermore, Moreover, In addition, Besides (Ayrıca, üstelik)
  - {koyu:Örnek Verme:} For instance, For example, Such as (Örneğin)
  - {koyu:Sonuç Bildirme:} In conclusion, To sum up, Consequently, Therefore (Sonuç olarak, bu nedenle).
